---
<SiteLayout {...metadata}>
    <main class="home-page" id="main-content">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
        <div class="container hero-grid">
          <div class="hero-intro">
            <p class="home-eyebrow">蔡泓恩 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> 職能治療師</p>
            <h1 id="intro-title">
              把臨床觀察<br />
              轉化為<span>復健工具。</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="hero-copy">
              從視覺評估、臨床研究，到開源工具開發，<br class="hero-copy-break" />
              讓研究回到日常，讓練習更容易開始。
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="button-primary" href="/blog">閱讀專業文章</a>
              <a class="button-secondary" href="/projects">查看開源工具</a>
            </div>
            <p class="hero-affiliation">國立臺灣大學 職能治療碩士班<br />台灣視覺復健專業服務協會 研究助理</p>
          </div>
          <figure class="hero-profile">
            <div class="portrait">
              <img src="/assets/ian-tsai.jpg" alt="蔡泓恩，職能治療師" width="1271" height="1747" fetchpriority="high" />
            </div>
            <figcaption><strong>Hung-En (Ian) Tsai</strong><span>臨床・研究・數位實作</span></figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
        <nav class="container home-index" aria-label="首頁章節">
          <a href="#focus-title"><span>01</span>專業領域</a>
          <a href="#trainerhub-title"><span>02</span>數位實作</a>
          <a href="#academic-title"><span>03</span>學術成果</a>
          <a href="#experience-title"><span>04</span>學經歷</a>
        </nav>
      </section>

      <section class="section section-muted" aria-labelledby="focus-title">
        <div class="container split">
          <div class="split-intro">
            <p class="home-eyebrow">01 / 專業領域</p>
            <h2 id="focus-title">從看見問題，<br />到支持日常生活</h2>
            <p>在臨床與研究中反覆出現的問題，我會寫成練習工具或自動化流程。這三項是我持續投入的方向。</p>
          </div>
          <dl class="focus-list">
            <div>
              <dt>視覺復健</dt>
              <dd>針對視野缺損、半側忽略與眼球動作控制問題，設計視覺掃描與注意力訓練。</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>功能性評估</dt>
              <dd>從日常活動需求出發，辨識影響獨立生活的視覺障礙，作為治療計畫的基準。</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>數位健康工具</dt>
              <dd>把門診叫號追蹤、文獻搜尋與論文整理等重複工作寫成工具，減少行政時間。</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section home-product" aria-labelledby="trainerhub-title">
        <div class="container platform-highlight">
          <div class="platform-highlight-copy">
            <p class="home-eyebrow">02 / 數位實作</p>
            <h2 id="trainerhub-title">把練習，<br />帶回日常。</h2>
            <p class="platform-name">TrainerHub 居家復健訓練網</p>
            <p>整合動作、視覺、認知與口腔練習，以及衛教資訊。以瀏覽器開啟，也可安裝為 PWA，讓居家練習多一個入口。</p>
            <ul class="platform-capabilities">
              <li>練習參數設定</li>
              <li>成績 CSV 匯出</li>
              <li>經審核的開發者遊戲庫</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="button-primary" href="https://trainerhub.cc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">開啟 TrainerHub<span class="animate-icon" data-animate-icon="external-link" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
              <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ian030590/RehabTrainerHub" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看原始碼</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <TrainerHubPreview />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="academic-title">
        <div class="container">
          <header class="home-section-heading">
            <div><p class="home-eyebrow">03 / 學術成果</p><h2 id="academic-title" class="section-title">讓臨床提問，<br />成為研究的起點</h2></div>
            <p class="academic-section-lead">
            以臨床實務與復能需求為出發點，聚焦於雙眼視覺、深度知覺評估、低視能輔具處方與神經視覺損傷復健的實證研究。
            </p>
          </header>

          <div class="academic-layout">
            <article class="academic-thesis-card">
              <div class="academic-thesis-header">
                <span class="academic-badge">{thesisProject.category}</span>
                <span class="academic-status">{thesisProject.status}</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="academic-thesis-title">{thesisProject.title}</h3>
              <div class="academic-thesis-meta">
                <span>{thesisProject.institution}</span>
                <span>·</span>
                <span>{thesisProject.advisor}</span>
              </div>
            </article>

            <div>
              <h3 class="academic-subheading">研討會發表與論文</h3>
              <div class="academic-list">
                {publications.map((item) => (
                  <details class="academic-card">
                    <summary>
                      <div class="academic-card-header">
                        <span class:list={['academic-badge', item.badgeClass]}>{item.type}</span>
                        <time class="academic-date" datetime={item.date.replace('/', '-')}>{item.date}</time>
                      </div>
                      <h4 class="academic-card-title">{item.title}</h4>
                      <div class="academic-conference">{item.conference}</div>
                      <span class="academic-expand"><span class="academic-expand-label">摘要與作者</span><span class="academic-expand-mark" aria-hidden="true">+</span></span>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="academic-card-body">
                      <div class="academic-authors">
                        <span class="academic-author-label">作者：</span>
                        <span>{item.authors}</span>
                      </div>
                      <p class="academic-card-desc">{item.summary}</p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section section-muted" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
        <div class="container">
          <p class="home-eyebrow">04 / 學經歷</p>
          <h2 id="experience-title" class="section-title">學經歷</h2>
          <div class="timeline-columns">
            <div>
              <h3 class="timeline-heading">工作經歷</h3>
              <div class="timeline">
                {work.map((item) => (
                  <article class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-period">{item.period}</div>
                    <h4>{item.title}</h4>
                    <div class="timeline-org">{item.org}</div>
                    <p>{item.description}</p>
                  </article>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="timeline-heading">學歷</h3>
              <div class="timeline">
                {education.map((item) => (
                  <article class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-period">{item.period}</div>
                    <h4>{item.title}</h4>
                    <div class="timeline-org">{item.org}</div>
                    <p>{item.description}</p>
                  </article>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section home-contact" aria-labelledby="home-contact-title">
        <div class="container">
          <div><p class="home-eyebrow">研究交流 / 工具開發</p><h2 id="home-contact-title">有想一起解決的問題？</h2><p>歡迎聊聊視覺復健、臨床研究，或數位工具的應用。</p></div>
          <a class="button-primary" href="/contact">聯絡我</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
</SiteLayout>
